  Pure-white silhouette on transparent background — the Android system status
  bar tints all notification small-icons to white anyway and a non-white
  silhouette renders as a flat white square on most OEM skins. This is the
  standard Material small-icon convention.

  Shape: filled check-circle (Material symbol). Conveys "fact-checked" — aligns
  with the bubble's brand role without needing a custom asset.
-->
